<title>PHILIPPINES: Asiatrust sees Q1 net at 30-40 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Asiatrust sees Q1 net at 30-40 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine private development bank Asiatrust Development Bank Inc sees first quarter net income from July to September at 30 to 40 million pesos, Asiatrust executive vice president Roland Garcia said.</p>
<p>The newly-listed bank is targeting a net income of 250 million pesos for the full fiscal year, Garcia said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
